{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disposable Corps</strong>\u00a0is a fun, low-poly style, team-based PvP tactical shooter that can be played in both first-person and third-person perspectives, set against the backdrop of classic trench warfare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will fight intense, chaotic battles with dynamic frontline shifts between attackers and defenders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579070/extras/2bec08b6a99e7e362ef198318664a260.poster.avif?t=1760469288\" width=544 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579070/extras/2bec08b6a99e7e362ef198318664a260.webm?t=1760469288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579070/extras/2bec08b6a99e7e362ef198318664a260.mp4?t=1760469288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core battlefield experience: one side digs in, the other storms in. Watch the clash unfold!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579070/extras/8b11453976dd77bf58cc33ddc71b181a.poster.avif?t=1760469288\" width=544 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579070/extras/8b11453976dd77bf58cc33ddc71b181a.webm?t=1760469288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579070/extras/8b11453976dd77bf58cc33ddc71b181a.mp4?t=1760469288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > No cover is truly safe! From artillery barrages to relentless digging, the battlefield constantly changes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579070/extras/0bef80882b20d6ab5c4f599bfaef3e8d.poster.avif?t=1760469288\" width=544 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579070/extras/0bef80882b20d6ab5c4f599bfaef3e8d.webm?t=1760469288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579070/extras/0bef80882b20d6ab5c4f599bfaef3e8d.mp4?t=1760469288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before the battle begins, players can digging trenches, setting up barricades, and turning the terrain into a fortress.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579070/extras/61b6e8417f6eceb3b04eac5b5bfc968d.poster.avif?t=1760469288\" width=544 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579070/extras/61b6e8417f6eceb3b04eac5b5bfc968d.webm?t=1760469288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579070/extras/61b6e8417f6eceb3b04eac5b5bfc968d.mp4?t=1760469288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow, unstoppable advances\u2014armored vehicles and old tanks lead the way, with infantry charging right behind.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579070/extras/5ecd6fe70a458fb9182d2148a43a641c.poster.avif?t=1760469288\" width=544 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579070/extras/5ecd6fe70a458fb9182d2148a43a641c.webm?t=1760469288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579070/extras/5ecd6fe70a458fb9182d2148a43a641c.mp4?t=1760469288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trench warfare at its most intense: close-range firefights, melee brawls, and last-stand defenses where every second counts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579070/extras/66d856c3972f8344b9ba5021f03a9b55.poster.avif?t=1760469288\" width=544 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579070/extras/66d856c3972f8344b9ba5021f03a9b55.webm?t=1760469288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579070/extras/66d856c3972f8344b9ba5021f03a9b55.mp4?t=1760469288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command of your own squad. Issue orders and coordinate your unit to outmaneuver and outgun the enemy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3579070?t=1760469288","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579070/df2a773bc0f612e19841597ded750f2c927becaf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760469288","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579070/b86ced88130a895c0ca462c553700eedd887815f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760469288","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579070/b86ced88130a895c0ca462c553700eedd887815f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760469288","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game depicts realistic trench warfare with intense and graphic violence, including blood, gore, and dismemberment. Players will experience large-scale battles, close-quarters combat, and artillery bombardments, all presented with a high level of realism. While there is no sexual content, the game includes mature war themes such as battlefield injuries, historical weaponry, and intense combat scenarios."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disposable Corps</strong>\u00a0is a fun, low-poly style, team-based PvP tactical shooter that can be played in both first-person and third-person perspectives, set against the backdrop of classic trench warfare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will fight intense, chaotic battles with dynamic frontline shifts between attackers and defenders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579070/extras/2bec08b6a99e7e362ef198318664a260.poster.avif?t=1760469288\" width=544 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app